      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CITY OF SIN (3) got well back over 1435m at Broome last time and never threatened, eventually finishing well back in 11th. Was on the quick turnaround there and over an unsuitable trip. Perfectly placed and is sure to take plenty of stopping. ARROGANT MISS (8) is racing well and is close to a win, the latest effort a solid second at Katherine over 1100m. Finds the right race this time and can get the job done. I'M A DREAMER (7) returns from a layoff of three-and-a-half months. Worth noting he filled a minor placing when returning from a spell last prep over 1200m at Darwin. Has to be respected. WARREGO (1) returned from a spell three weeks ago when he was beaten 3.5 lengths into fourth over 1200m at Darwin. Fitter and sure to run well. WICKED ONE (5) is a winner here previously and can't be discounted.",
